# Rockalanche {2}{G}: "Earthbend X, where X is the number of Forests you control." Bot1 has one Forest when it casts the spell (X = 1: the
# Forest becomes a 1/1 haste land creature), then plays a second Forest and, two turns later, a Wastes, and flashes the card back for {5}{G}
# onto the Wastes while Bot2 also controls a Forest: X counts only Bot1's two Forests - not its Wastes, not Bot2's Forest - so the Wastes
# gets exactly two counters (CR 701.66a, 702.34a, 608.2h). The flashed-back card is exiled.

